---
// src/components/ca-bot/CaBotFaq.astro
---
<section class="py-24 bg-slate-50 w-full">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight">
        Frequently asked questions
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-6">
      
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Who connects the Tally, me or my client?</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600 font-medium leading-relaxed">
          Usually you, since you hold the books. If a client runs their own Tally, we help connect it.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Is it really free?</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600 font-medium leading-relaxed">
          Yes. Free for your firm and your clients, with no per-client charge.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Can clients change data through the bot?</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600 font-medium leading-relaxed">
          No. It only reads the books and answers questions.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">I manage a lot of clients. Is that a problem?</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600 font-medium leading-relaxed">
          No. We set clients up in batches to make it completely seamless for you.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Which software does it work with?</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600 font-medium leading-relaxed">
          TallyPrime.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
